{"metadata":{"name":"Sunan Abu Dawud","name_native":"سنن أبي داود","section":{"11":"The Rites of Hajj (Kitab Al-Manasik Wa'l-Hajj)"},"section_detail":{"11":{"hadithnumber_first":1721,"hadithnumber_last":2045,"arabicnumber_first":1721,"arabicnumber_last":2045,"name_native":"كتاب المناسك والحج"}}},"hadiths":[{"hadithnumber":1926,"arabicnumber":1926,"text":"حدثنا عبد الله بن مسلمة، عن مالك، عن ابن شهاب، عن سالم بن عبد الله، عن عبد الله بن عمر، ان رسول الله صلى الله عليه وسلم صلى المغرب والعشاء بالمزدلفة جميعا","grades":[{"name":"Al-Albani","grade":"Sahih"},{"name":"Muhammad Muhyi Al-Din Abdul Hamid","grade":"Sahih"},{"name":"Shuaib Al Arnaut","grade":"Sahih"},{"name":"Zubair Ali Zai","grade":"Sahih Muslim (703 After  1287)"}],"reference":{"book":11,"hadith":206}}]}